    <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full bg-code-red-soft px-2 py-[2px] text-[12px] leading-4 text-code-error">error</span><span class="text-code-error">ZEN-EVT-STRING-HANDLER</span></p>
    <p>Event attributes do not accept string handlers.</p>
    <p class="text-code-muted">{'Found: on:click="doThing" at line ‹n›, column ‹n›.'}</p>
    <p class="flex items-start gap-2 text-code-success"><span class="text-[12px] leading-[22px]">fix</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1">Use on:event=&#123;handler&#125; with a function-valued expression.</span></p>
